OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and breezy to start with
OL,6,Flight rain arriving across the region
OL,7,Fthrough the early morning. The rain
OL,8,Fturns patchy by the early afternoon
OL,9,Fand remaining cloudy for most.
OL,10,FFreshening winds. Turning mild for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy with
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain. The odd clear spell
OL,15,Fovernight but a further band of rain,
OL,16,Flocally heavy, arrives in the
OL,17,Fnorthwest by dawn. Mild. Strong, gusty
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
